cff-version: 1.2.0
title: NeuroFlow
message: If you use NeuroFlow, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Senra Filho
    given-names: Antonio Carlos
    email: acsenrafilho@users.noreply.github.com
repository-code: https://github.com/acsenrafilho/neuroflow
url: https://neuroflowpipelines.readthedocs.io/
abstract: >-
  NeuroFlow is a web portal that wraps neuroimaging CLI tools with one
  independent page per program (FreeSurfer, FSL, Spinal Cord Toolbox).
  It provides upload, parameter forms, command preview, and local
  subprocess execution via FastAPI and HTML/Tailwind.
keywords:
  - neuroimaging
  - neuroscience
  - FreeSurfer
  - FSL
  - Spinal Cord Toolbox
  - FastAPI
  - MRI
license: MIT
version: 0.0.1
